Movie Commentary Workflow — integrated edition

Based on https://github.com/straighttttt/movie-commentary-workflow
Upstream base: 3d50c17 (Initial open-source skills edition).
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is preserved in LICENSE.

This edition integrates reusable local shot-indexing, voice-cloning helpers,
macOS OCR/music utilities, portable setup instructions and synthetic tests.
It does not distribute film footage, subtitles, generated films, cloned voices,
API credentials, proprietary models or operating-system sound banks.
